 "title": "Inkling 2 Mini runs on a laptop",
 "date": "2026-11-20",
 "summary": "Thinking Machines released a 26.4-billion-parameter open-weight model that it says needs about 20 GB. Others have made much smaller builds.",
 "topics": [
